{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9300.19327,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9739.511796,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9809.016585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9813.998944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9819.436867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9824.775371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9829.970487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9834.759478,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":21341.301301,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21828.478675,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21887.526802999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21892.496483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21898.142502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21903.164081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21908.556493999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21913.618790999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21916.53501,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":34248.543543,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34594.955844,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34672.752165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34678.402603999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34683.454592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":34688.549449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34693.860874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":34698.31521,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":45135.482359,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45625.521922,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45683.675893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45685.032223999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45686.546711999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45688.016682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45689.669808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45691.227006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45692.765704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45694.962911999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45696.559049999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45696.899825,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52137.014553,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52410.017811,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":52472.207574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52477.303480999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52482.667445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52487.795532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52491.527107999995,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":62511.711243,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62783.778633999995,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62834.485031,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62835.988159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62837.651445999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62838.02562,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62875.436987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62880.707252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62885.926317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62886.466349999995,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75488.365245,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":75964.223411,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":76019.057329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76023.96960899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76029.116665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76034.40817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76039.512527,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76044.164121,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":77711.324721,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77907.886698,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77952.314725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77957.619209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77962.48471,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":90734.76581499999,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":90981.535327,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":91027.269885,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91032.32668299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91037.584308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":91037.848864,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":91101.004474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91106.84989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":91107.065397,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101117.597609,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101458.36038099999,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101509.222976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101514.787176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101519.937593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101525.551413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":101525.831349,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101577.030229,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101582.243855,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101587.627008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101591.715259,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":107840.54031499999,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108108.720241,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":108152.432538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108154.255912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":108155.862989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108157.507726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":108157.764942,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116353.180694,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116718.85119,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116774.637074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116779.704142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116784.74446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116790.231282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116795.453058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116796.487393,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127102.303977,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127488.80787599999,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127564.527567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127569.80777099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127575.09054599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127580.295002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127585.506887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127591.022199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127596.122936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127596.769217,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138027.639656,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138391.59529700002,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138455.19408000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138460.427575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138463.62610000002,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138510.23612500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138515.5087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138520.87560300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138526.04506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138529.694648,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138577.18316100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138579.721544,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":151178.327026,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151632.464611,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151688.294025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151689.755244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151691.206684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151692.775881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":151694.383368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151696.005745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151697.55369300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":151699.17655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":151700.676699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":151701.04699300003,"samples":11088,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159346.483947,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159613.077395,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159672.172763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159673.74511000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159675.1945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159676.81177700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159677.78696300002,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167780.72793300002,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168112.48304300001,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":168152.859937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168154.866469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168156.010102,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":168228.64841700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168230.178595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168231.94252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":168232.318604,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":179441.18522,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179828.429359,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179895.838518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179897.52417400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179899.091141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179900.674799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179902.20609700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179903.81915400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179905.55882900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179905.749156,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":189568.385859,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189878.178382,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":189926.61837100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189931.971265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":189937.429837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189942.231348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189947.185128,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":199979.263733,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200378.102656,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200429.02968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200436.59445200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200442.94273200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200449.752715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200453.50067100002,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200496.04083500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200496.428729,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":212864.693105,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":213183.118225,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":213246.41563300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":213251.74130700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213256.84191400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213262.215857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213267.675189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213272.54944,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"close","t":224604.797377,"code":1005}]}